{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノギルームで思い出した～NOGIBINGOにも出させて貰ったんだけど皆の応援団めっちゃ良かったよね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録時間あっという間に感じたもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ順番バラバラになっちゃったけど\nななみんノギルームのお手紙ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しかったよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっぴり恥ずかしかったけど...\nでももっと恥ずかしいのは\nお手紙貰った人はキス顔しなきゃいけなかったからそれがめっちゃ恥ずかしかった...\n(*ﾉωﾉ)ﾎﾟｯ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげで握手会で何回もキス顔求められた～(´･ε･｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆まあやのキス顔見るなんてレアだかんなっ\n///꒰⑅•ᴗ•⑅꒱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(↑中３の時のまあや...なんかちょっぴり幼いよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGOの収録の日が東京に来ていたお母さんが帰る日だったから、休憩時間に待ち合わせしてランチに行ったのまあやはあまりお腹すいてないな～って思ってたんだけどね、、ピザをパクパク食べて お母さんのパスタも少しもらって食べちゃった～笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録が終わって間に合ったら東京駅に見送りに行くね～って言ってバイバイして、終わって直ぐに東京駅に行って少し話したよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣かないよ～だっ！ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんが、\nファンの方が長い時間をかけてしてくれた大切な生誕祭にお邪魔してしまって申し訳なかったです。\nでも、まあやには こんなに素敵な人達が周りにいてくれて まあやを育ててくれてるんだとわかって安心と感謝で胸がいっぱいになりました。\nって言ってた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれだけの生誕祭をするのは大変だと思う\n本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はある事をしてきます～（≧∇≦）\n報告出来る日を楽しみにしていてね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、れいか、れなち、なあちゃん、せいらりん、かりんちゃんも生誕祭あったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0022.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"happybirthday"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわごちゃんのPopteenまあやに出来るのは1票だけど、役に立てたら嬉しいな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちゃんの夢が叶いますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと前回の質問の答え\nお好み焼きにマヨネーズって人多かった～\nまあやもだよ～笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに瀬戸田のレモンも有名だよ\nお土産屋さんにレモンのお菓子も売ってるよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏のコンサート行くよ～って方へ\n盛り上がろうね～*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の神宮まで駆け抜けるぞー‼️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっそうそう\n親の事をなんて呼ぶ？？\nお父さん、お母さん かな？\n下の名前？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかね、最近の人はあだ名で読んだりするらしいよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0029.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんから貰った栽培セット芽が出たよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！テスト期間だから仕事終わっておうちついたら勉強しまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生さんがんばろ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0033.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/25/4159370/0034.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}